{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Decorate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate your catio to attract cats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you purchase and place higher quality decorations, your catio will attract cats with more discerning tastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/f6a9185a41be46300a1f1655cac9d124.poster.avif?t=1753984846\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/f6a9185a41be46300a1f1655cac9d124.webm?t=1753984846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/f6a9185a41be46300a1f1655cac9d124.mp4?t=1753984846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pet Cats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pet your cats to prepare them for adoption. Once they're ready, collect their adoption fees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/d5970a79bd41b69143fe8916eb429b8f.poster.avif?t=1753984846\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/d5970a79bd41b69143fe8916eb429b8f.webm?t=1753984846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/d5970a79bd41b69143fe8916eb429b8f.mp4?t=1753984846\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Buy Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automate and improve your petting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814540/extras/390401076d8f208be8fb71e261c61d21.avif?t=1753984846\" /></div></p><p 